{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>這批圖片還展示了Jason與Lucia在不同畫面中的髮型和外觀變化，為觀察兩名主角的造型提供了更多畫面。</p>\n<p>之前GameInformer《GTA6》專題曾展示12張新截圖。Love雜誌此次展示的是之後出現的另一批圖片，兩批截圖並非同一次公開的內容。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》新截圖公佈：女主身材性感 男主帥氣瀟灑\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261003/1790973761_999393.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》新截圖公佈：女主身材性感 男主帥氣瀟灑\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261003/1790973761_520744.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》新截圖公佈：女主身材性感 男主帥氣瀟灑\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261003/1790973761_533478_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》新截圖公佈：女主身材性感 男主帥氣瀟灑\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261003/1790973762_826800_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》新截圖公佈：女主身材性感 男主帥氣瀟灑\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261003/1790972775_659924_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》新截圖公佈：女主身材性感 男主帥氣瀟灑\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261003/1790973761_999393.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》新截圖公佈：女主身材性感 男主帥氣瀟灑\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261003/1790973761_520744.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》新截圖公佈：女主身材性感 男主帥氣瀟灑\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261003/1790973761_533478_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》新截圖公佈：女主身材性感 男主帥氣瀟灑\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261003/1790973762_826800_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-03T06:18:27.179413+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":9,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}